## Key Concepts
- Cross-region write routing and primary selection
- Read-after-write consistency during failover
- Cache invalidation and cross-region warmup
- Outbox pattern and idempotent sinks across regions
- Observability: replication lag, latency, and error budgets
- Feature flags, canary rollouts, rollback criteria

## Code Example
```javascript
async function handleEvent(event){
  await db.transaction(async trx => {
    await trx('outbox').insert({payload: event, processed: false});
    await trx('orders').update({status: 'updated'}).where({id: event.id});
  });
  publishToKafka(event.id);
  markOutboxAsProcessed(event.id);
}
```

